<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>me &amp; u</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Luke Chiang, HILLARI</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">TYPHOON</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">5R9eJdGi0hzYRajiqyq62h</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.582" end="00:16.510">You got your baggage</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.510" end="00:20.067">Lord knows that I got mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.067" end="00:23.866">I’m wondering if it’s still worth a try</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.866" end="00:26.692" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.692" end="00:29.252">I know you’re damaged</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.252" end="00:32.776">Stories you’ve left behind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.776" end="00:36.293">But I knew you would come around with time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.293" end="00:37.793" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.232" end="00:41.634">Half of my head is</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.634" end="00:44.289">Taken</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.289" end="00:48.734">But I’m saving space for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.734" end="00:50.234" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.883" end="00:54.407">Though half of my heart is</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.407" end="00:57.454">Breaking</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.454" end="01:01.643">You &amp; I should see this through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:01.643" end="01:03.143" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.974" end="01:06.268">What can I say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.268" end="01:09.638">I’d never change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.638" end="01:12.707">Me &amp; you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.707" end="01:18.360" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.360" end="01:21.210">Some reassurance</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:21.210" end="01:24.484">Is all that I need sometimes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.484" end="01:27.826">You know I’m the overthinking type</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.826" end="01:29.326" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.150" end="01:32.315">Don’t matter if it’s rain or shine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.315" end="01:35.971">Would you still be my ride or die</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.971" end="01:37.897">Cause I</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.897" end="01:41.347">Couldn’t even leave you if I tried</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.347" end="01:42.847" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.739" end="01:45.876">Half of my head is</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.876" end="01:48.548">Taken</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.548" end="01:53.508">But I’m saving space for you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.508" end="01:55.008" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:53.829" end="01:58.724">Though half of my heart is</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.724" end="02:02.148">Breaking</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.148" end="02:06.242">You &amp; I should see this through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.242" end="02:07.742" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.631" end="02:10.579">What can I say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.579" end="02:14.437">I’d never change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.437" end="02:15.937">Me &amp; you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.919" end="02:17.419" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.033" end="02:18.757">I’m only human</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:18.757" end="02:26.100">I was so stupid to think there was me without you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:26.100" end="02:28.866" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:28.866" end="02:31.497">Please don’t pretend</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:31.497" end="02:34.662">Like we’re not a mess</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.662" end="02:39.127">I don’t care let’s just do what we do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.127" end="02:40.627" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:39.839" end="02:44.011">What can I say</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.011" end="02:46.991">I’d never change</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.991" end="02:50.991">Me and you</p></div></body></tt>